{"item_uid": "指考98-chemistry-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "chemistry", "subject_zh": "化學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "四氧化二氮與甲聯胺（ CH NHNH ）的反應為登月小艇脫離月球返回地球時所\n3 2\n用的動力來源。此二化合物反應的生成物為水、氮氣與二氧化碳。試問此反應\n的平衡化學反應式中，水與氮氣的係數比為何？", "options": {"A": "4：3", "B": "3：4", "C": "3：2", "D": "3：1", "E": "1：3"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 55.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 13.0, "E": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 72.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 9.0, "E": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 34.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 17.0, "E": 3.0}, "omit_rate": 12.0, "p_value": 55.0, "p_high": 72.0, "p_low": 34.0, "discrimination": 38.0, "p_quintiles": [76.0, 64.0, 60.0, 50.0, 24.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-chemistry-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "chemistry", "subject_zh": "化學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "乙醇俗稱酒精。下列有關酒精的敘述，何者正確？\n（甲）純酒精與乙酸反應會產生乙酸乙酯\n（乙）在純酒精中，投入金屬鈉會產生氫氣\n（丙）純酒精經濃硫酸脫水後，可產生乙烯或乙醚\n（丁）酒精中是否含有水，可以用白色的硫酸銅來檢驗\n（戊）工業上製備無水酒精，較經濟的方法是先加無水硫酸銅乾燥後蒸餾", "options": {"A": "甲乙丙", "B": "乙丙丁", "C": "甲丁戊", "D": "甲乙丙丁", "E": "甲乙丙戊"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 9.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 50.0, "E": 7.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 7.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 76.0, "E": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 11.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 24.0, "E": 10.0}, "omit_rate": 12.0, "p_value": 50.0, "p_high": 76.0, "p_low": 24.0, "discrimination": 52.0, "p_quintiles": [81.0, 66.0, 51.0, 35.0, 19.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-chemistry-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "chemistry", "subject_zh": "化學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "針對氨、氖、苯及硫化氫四種物質，各在其液態的粒子間作用力之敘述，何者\n正確？", "options": {"A": "氨不具有氫鍵", "B": "苯與硫化氫不具有分散力", "C": "氨與硫化氫均具有偶極作用力", "D": "苯為對稱分子，故無凡得瓦力", "E": "氖係以單原子存在，故其粒子間無作用力"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 64.0, "D": 5.0, "E": 7.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 94.0, "D": 1.0, "E": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 31.0, "D": 10.0, "E": 12.0}, "omit_rate": 15.0, "p_value": 64.0, "p_high": 94.0, "p_low": 31.0, "discrimination": 63.0, "p_quintiles": [97.0, 86.0, 67.0, 43.0, 25.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-chemistry-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "chemistry", "subject_zh": "化學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "小華將 8.4 克的某液態化合物置於 8.2 升體積固定的密閉容器中，自 280K 開\n始加熱，溫度逐漸升至 360K。小華記錄容器內氣體壓力隨溫度的變化如圖 2。\n300\n250\n)gHmm(\n200\nP 150\n100\n50\n280 290 300 310 320 330 340 350 360\nT (K)\n圖2\n試問此化合物之分子量（g/mol）最接近下列哪一數值？", "options": {"A": "60", "B": "72", "C": "84", "D": "96", "E": "108\n- 3 -\n98年指考 第 4 頁\n化學考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 49.0, "D": 5.0, "E": 7.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 81.0, "D": 2.0, "E": 3.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 5.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 20.0, "D": 8.0, "E": 9.0}, "omit_rate": 27.0, "p_value": 49.0, "p_high": 81.0, "p_low": 20.0, "discrimination": 61.0, "p_quintiles": [88.0, 67.0, 48.0, 28.0, 16.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-chemistry-012", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "chemistry", "subject_zh": "化學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 12, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "濃度均為 0.1M 的下列五種物質的水溶液：\n（甲） NH （乙） NH Cl （丙） CH COOH\n3 4 3\n（丁） CH COONa （戊） CH COONH\n3 3 4\n試問其pH值由低至高的排列順序，下列哪一選項正確？", "options": {"A": "乙丙戊甲丁", "B": "丙乙丁戊甲", "C": "乙丙丁甲戊", "D": "戊丙乙甲丁", "E": "丙乙戊丁甲"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "E", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 18.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 4.0, "E": 48.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 16.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 1.0, "E": 77.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 17.0, "B": 24.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 9.0, "E": 23.0}, "omit_rate": 10.0, "p_value": 48.0, "p_high": 77.0, "p_low": 23.0, "discrimination": 54.0, "p_quintiles": [84.0, 64.0, 46.0, 32.0, 18.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
